%h1 Admin
%p.mb-32 These are the pages you can use to run Exercism. Each group needs a different level of access.

- groups = ViewComponents::Admin::Nav.groups_for(current_user)
- groups.each do |group, items|
  %section.c-admin-dashboard-group
    %h2= group.title
    .cards
      - items.each do |item|
        = link_to item.url, class: "card", data: (item.external ? { turbo: false } : {}) do
          = graphical_icon(item.icon)
          .details
            .title= item.title
            .description= item.description
